  "body": "## REVIEW-ONLY PR \u2014 the merge decision belongs to the owner (R21-01 / R22-01 remediation)\n\nImplements `R19_CI_WIRING_PROPOSAL_v2_amended.patch` (from the TASK 22/23 audit package, vixor-deliverables PR #11) **verbatim in semantics**: limited diff, **+4/\u22121 across 2 files** (`bot-worker/package.json`, `.github/workflows/ci.yml`). No production logic touched, no test removed or weakened, no deploy config changed.\n\n### What it does\n1. `bot-worker/package.json`: adds a **self-sufficient** `regression` script \u2014 `tsc -p tests/smoke.tsconfig.json && node tests/alert01-regression.cjs` (fixes finding **N-1**: the previous proposal consumed the `.smoke` build artifact and failed `MODULE_NOT_FOUND` from a clean tree when invoked standalone).\n2. `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: adds the `ALERT-01 regression (R1-R19)` step to the **bot-worker** job, after smoke tests (v1 order was already safe; v2 additionally survives reordering/standalone invocation).\n\n### Local evidence (clean checkout, head `8d45f22eba3c598e451139fdeed6c1a29c938d0c`)\n| step | result | exit |\n|---|---|---|\n| `npm ci` | clean install | 0 |\n| `npm run regression` **BEFORE any build** (`.smoke` absent \u2014 proves v2 self-sufficiency) | **20/20 passed** | 0 |\n| `npm run typecheck` | clean | 0 |\n| `npm test` | **86/86 passed** | 0 |\n| `npm run regression` (CI order, post-build) | **20/20 passed** | 0 |\n\n**Negative test (gate is real, not decorative):** re-introducing the ALERT-01 bug (trackingPatch save-error detected but loud log suppressed) in a detached worktree \u2192 regression **FAILS 19/20, exit 1** with the expected reason: `trackingPatch update result was never checked \u2014 save error silently discarded`. (An earlier cruder mutation also failed the gate at the tsc stage, exit 2.)\n\n### CI\nGitHub Actions on this PR is bound to the head SHA recorded in the audit package (`TEST_EVIDENCE.md`, TASK 23 appendix). **This PR must not be merged** until the owner reviews it; R21-01 closes only after merge + green CI on a main SHA containing the change.\n\nRefs: vixor-deliverables PR #11 (audit package), RISK_REGISTER R21-01/R22-01, TEST_EVIDENCE TASK 23 appendix.\n",
